{
  "info": {
    "name": "多多 AI 全能管家 · E2E",
    "description": "覆盖：游客 3 轮拦截、登录续接、记忆两步确认、通知只消展示项、卡片准确性、DataFence 逃逸、外链拦截、跨用户越权。\n\n前置：\n1) 已执行 docs/sql/incremental/73、74 与 scripts/apply-73-ai-butler-ddl.ps1；\n2) 已按 docs/qa/ai-butler-e2e-matrix.md 注入通知夹具（买家 A 一条正常通知、买家 B 一条恶意标题通知）；\n3) 环境变量中的 otherOrderNo/otherUserId 指向买家 B；\n4) 每次运行都会生成新的游客 deviceId，避免复用已耗尽的配额。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('guestDevice')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('guestDevice', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$randomUUID}}'));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "guestDevice", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "buyerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otherToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "unreadBefore", "value": "" },
    { "key": "patchNotice", "value": "" },
    { "key": "hrToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
